      ],
      "plan": "Describe a hypothetical RAG sanity check comparing retrieval on/off. Detail the use of 30 local documents and questions with/without answers. Emphasize the hypothetical status and absence of real results. Seek community input on the design considerations for this comparative approach, particularly regarding unanswerable questions."
    }
  ]
